  "cues": [
   [
    0.1,
    "Chapter two, lesson one."
   ],
   [
    2.12,
    "What proteins are, and what they do."
   ],
   [
    4.685,
    "Look at an egg, a glass of milk, a handful of beans."
   ],
   [
    8.527,
    "Then think of your own hair, your nails, your skin."
   ],
   [
    11.808,
    "All of these are made largely of proteins."
   ],
   [
    14.399,
    "In chapter one we met the amino acid card: one amino acid, with its amino group, its carboxyl group, a hydrogen, and a side chain R, all on the alpha carbon."
   ],
   [
    25.31,
    "Now the amino acids stop standing alone."
   ],
   [
    28.201,
    "They line up and join into a chain."
   ],
   [
    30.61,
    "And that chain is a protein."
   ]
  ]
 },
