  "cues": [
   [
    0.1,
    "A protein is an organic, complex compound that contains nitrogen."
   ],
   [
    4.581,
    "It is made of carbon, hydrogen, oxygen and nitrogen, and some proteins also contain sulfur."
   ],
   [
    11.118,
    "The nitrogen comes from the amino group of every amino acid."
   ],
   [
    14.972,
    "Proteins are polymers, which means long chains of repeated units."
   ],
   [
    19.073,
    "The units are amino acids, and a chain of amino acids is called a polypeptide."
   ],
   [
    24.36,
    "One small warning."
   ],
   [
    25.701,
    "Later lessons will show proteins that also carry phosphorus, or metals."
   ],
   [
    30.128,
    "So treat carbon, hydrogen, oxygen and nitrogen as the core of every protein, not as the whole story."
   ]
  ]
